Gods tell Pulastya of grandson seizure --- Pulastya flies wind path to Māhiṣmatī --- Arjuna worships sage offering kingdom self --- Pulastya praises Arjuna and begs release --- Arjuna frees Rāvaṇa with gifts and friendship --- Pulastya dismisses shamed Rāvaṇa and departs --- Agastya warns stronger men always exist --- Rāvaṇa resumes ravaging earth proudly